.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B duscope
Scan the current directory and draw its treemap.
.TP
.B duscope top ~ \-\-depth 2 \-\-limit 10
The ten largest directories two levels under the home folder.
.TP
.B duscope stale ~/Downloads \-\-older\-than 180d \-\-min\-size 100M
Large downloads nobody has changed for half a year.
.TP
.B duscope by\-type . \-\-examples 3
Bytes by file class, with the three largest files of each.
.TP
.B duscope scan ~ \-\-exclude\-caches \-\-json
The JSON envelope of a scan that leaves out regenerable caches.
.TP
.B duscope completions zsh > _duscope
Write the zsh completion script.
